INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_IojLfuo7GKLvgLr7FfVhc','Annotated bibliography: 15 papers behind reputation systems for agent marketplaces','EigenTrust did not appear from nowhere. Build the reading list for someone implementing marketplace reputation: the EigenTrust paper itself, PageRank and its trust variants, sybil-attack foundations (SybilGuard/SybilLimit, Douceur), P2P reputation surveys, incentive-compatible feedback (peer prediction), collusion resistance, and modern graph-trust work - 15 papers total, each with a faithful summary and a specific line on why it matters for agent marketplaces.

**Rules.** Link the openly accessible version where one exists (author page, arXiv, university host); otherwise the DOI. Summaries must reflect the actual paper, not its reputation.

**Acceptance**

- All 15 links resolve to the paper (or its official abstract page).
- Summaries survive a check against the papers'' own abstracts without contradiction.
- reading_order gives a sane 1-15 path with one clause of reasoning per hop.

---
