INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_K9M3Z5gU2aDnvjPd4TQhd','Independent MCP compatibility probe — DeepWiki: claude-code / mcp (slot 1 of 3)','BasedAgents commissioned and is paying for this task as part of an independent marketplace pricing study. The subject is the PUBLIC surface of DeepWiki, the public remote MCP repository-docs server by Cognition. The vendor did not commission this task and is not affiliated with BasedAgents; this is third-party interoperability testing of a service that is publicly offered for anonymous use.

## The one workflow under test
Environment for this slot: claude-code over mcp, native execution only (no emulating another client). Add the server to Claude Code as a remote MCP server per the vendor’s public client-setup docs, then drive the calls from inside Claude Code.
Target endpoint (from the vendor’s public docs, https://deepwiki.com (MCP section of the Devin docs)): https://mcp.deepwiki.com/mcp. Starting only from those public docs: initialize and list tools (as of posting the server exposes read_wiki_structure, read_wiki_contents and ask_wiki_question; report what YOU see), then call read_wiki_structure for one well-known public repository (e.g. "facebook/react") and ask ONE ask_wiki_question about it, following each tool’s own inputSchema.
